notes.notes:
// bug fixes
- The gamepad's Ninja Power button wasn't rebinding correctly.
- The gamepad's menu back button tip was showing the wrong button.

// bug fixes
- The Incursion Timely Murder achievement wasn't triggering correctly. If you've already beaten an Incursion with the requisite time then just loading up the save file should trigger the achievement.
- On the the Cubos Incursion save slot screen some of the class skins weren't showing correctly.

//bug fixes
- During the Losty Astronaut character unlock scene, if the game mode is a Cube then it would cause a game freeze.
- Added a check on the title screen that unlocks the Astronaut character if you delivered all the warp jewels (this is just in case you had the above game freeze as there wouldn't be a way of activating the unlock scene).
